===Etymology===
Century 1911: from {{suffix|critic|ize|lang=en}}

From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|κριτικός||of or for judging, able to discern|lang=grc}}, from {{term|κρίσις||crisis|lang=grc}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|criticiz}}  (''transitive'' or ''intransitive'')

# To [[find fault]] (with something).
# To [[evaluate]] (something), [[assess]]ing its [[merit]]s and [[fault]]s.

